    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuation of the visual novel Escape to Moscow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game genre: visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in modern Russia, some time after the events of the bad ending of the first part. The main character will try to correct his mistakes and again rushes to meet adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you will have to help your friend Aliya escape from home again. During the game, you will need to make choices that will affect the plot. An exciting journey awaits you in Moscow and beyond. The goal of the game is to achieve a happy ending, which depends on the choices you make during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 6 playable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 game days.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 hours of exciting gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 10 locations.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuation of the visual novel Escape to Moscow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game genre: visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in modern Russia, some time after the events of the bad ending of the first part. The main character will try to correct his mistakes and again rushes to meet adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you will have to help your friend Aliya escape from home again. During the game, you will need to make choices that will affect the plot. An exciting journey awaits you in Moscow and beyond. The goal of the game is to achieve a happy ending, which depends on the choices you make during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 6 playable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 game days.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 hours of exciting gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 10 locations.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "This is a visual novel - a continuation of the game Escape to Moscow. More than 3 hours of gameplay, 6 game days. Immerse yourself in new adventures in Moscow and other locations. You need to help Aliya escape to freedom again! The plot of the game depends on the decisions you make.",
